                "caption": "Figure 1:State World Models withStateful Harness.The same initial frame and action can lead to different outcomes under different world states.\nThe harness executes predefined rules to determine the event before a frozen video model renders it, illustrated by the red and blue elemental states.\nThe generated clip provides the visual anchor for the next turn.",
